bw.msg.intro_1=§8[FOUND FOOTAGE]§r §7Every night you spend in the woods, something finds you a little sooner.
bw.msg.intro_2=§8[FOUND FOOTAGE]§r §7If you see stick figures in the trees, leave. If you see a house, don't go down to the basement. And if someone is facing the corner... don't go near.

