bw.note.1=§7A crumpled note: "The creek is east. We've walked east all day."
bw.note.2=§7A crumpled note: "Three piles of rocks by the tent. Three. Like us."
bw.note.3=§7A crumpled note: "The figures hang from every tree. Nobody heard them being hung."
bw.note.4=§7A crumpled note: "We're back at the same fallen log. Third time today."
bw.note.5=§7A crumpled note: "Children laughing in the dark. There are no children out here."
bw.note.6=§7A crumpled note: "They say he made them face the corner. So they wouldn't see him."

