bw.msg.intro_3=§8[FOUND FOOTAGE]§r §7Use the camera for the first time to start filming. Josh and Mike will come with you.
bw.msg.crew_start=§7§o● The documentary begins. October, Black Hills Forest, near Burkittsville.
bw.crew.josh.start=Is it rolling? Okay. This'll be easy. Two nights and we're out.
bw.crew.mike.start=You've got the map, right? Because I'm not carrying it.
bw.crew.josh.n1=Did you hear that? That was a branch. Something big.
bw.crew.mike.n2=I'm not sleeping. There's someone out there, I heard them!
bw.crew.josh.n3=Stop filming me. Seriously. Turn the camera off.
bw.crew.mike.n4=This is your fault. You got us lost. You got us lost!
bw.crew.mike.n5=Do you hear that? It's Josh. He's out there... screaming.
bw.crew.mike.cairns=Who put these rocks here? Three piles. This isn't funny.
bw.crew.mike.map=...I kicked it in the creek. The map. It was useless, okay?
bw.crew.mike.josh_gone=Josh? JOSH! ...His stuff is still here. He wouldn't leave without his stuff.
bw.crew.josh.tent=What is that?! There's something out there! It's shaking the tent!
bw.crew.josh.circles=No. No, no, no. It's the same log. We walked in a circle all day.
bw.crew.mike.house=It's Josh! He's in there! JOSH! I'm going after him!
bw.msg.josh_gone=§7You wake up and Josh is gone. His backpack is still by the tent.
bw.msg.josh_scream=§7§oFar off to the §f%s§7§o, someone is screaming. It sounds like Josh.
bw.msg.bundle_josh=§7Beside you lies a bundle of twigs wrapped in red flannel. It's Josh's shirt.
bw.msg.mike_runs=§7Mike runs for the house. He doesn't look back.
bw.msg.tent=§4§oSomething is shaking the tent!
bw.msg.circles=§7In front of you is the same fallen log from this morning. You walked in a circle.

bw.apology.1=§f"I just want to apologize. Coming here was my idea."
bw.apology.2=§f"I'm sorry to your families. And to mine."
bw.apology.3=§f"I'm afraid to close my eyes... and I'm afraid to open them."
bw.apology.4=§f"We're going to die out here."

